# NOTE: src/compliance/owasp_agentic_generated.go is intentionally COMMITTED
# (un-gitignored in v0.10.0 #169). The verify-drift CI job runs `go generate
# ./...` and asserts no diff against the committed copy — that's the
# canonical drift check.

